# Copy this file to ".env" and fill in your real value.
#
# WANDERLOG_COOKIE is your Wanderlog login session cookie (the "connect.sid"
# value). It lets the MCP server act on your behalf, so treat it like a
# password and NEVER commit the real value to git.
#
# How to get it:
#   1. Log in at https://wanderlog.com in your browser.
#   2. Open DevTools (press F12) and go to the "Application" (Chrome/Edge)
#      or "Storage" (Firefox) tab.
#   3. Expand Cookies -> https://wanderlog.com
#   4. Click the cookie named "connect.sid" and copy its full Value.
#      It starts with "s%3A" and is roughly 100 characters long.
#   5. Paste it below.

WANDERLOG_COOKIE=s%3A...your-connect.sid-value-here...
